  "summary": "Two churches, one shared bulletin; page 1 prints a clear schedule by church, so every weekend and weekday Mass, the Saturday (5:00 PM) and Wednesday (12:00 PM) Assumption Confession and the first-Saturday Resurrection Confession are settled, and the three readable bulletins agree. The first-Saturday 8:00 AM Resurrection Mass is settled by R12 (only the Sept 27 bulletin's week holds one). One question: first-Friday Adoration at Assumption, because the website says it alternates between the two parishes (lean: leave out). The Columbus Day Mass (Oct 12, 9:00 AM at Resurrection) is a dated Mass; the bulletin does not say the usual Monday Masses are cancelled (R17).",
